  "Somebody kept the Scrap Baron's books. Whatever was in his strongbox might say who.": "有人替废铁男爵管账。他保险箱里的东西也许能说明是谁。",
  "There are rumours in Scrapton of a market that sells what Halcyon loses. Nobody says where.": "废铁镇有传言说，有个市场专卖哈尔西恩丢掉的东西。没人说在哪儿。",
  "A black market in the Ash Dunes. They buy what Halcyon loses and sell it to the people Halcyon forgot.": "灰烬沙丘里的一个黑市。他们收购哈尔西恩丢掉的东西，再卖给被哈尔西恩遗忘的人。",
  "They think you work for the sky. A burnt page says where to meet them: the Baron's old wreck, after dark.": "他们以为你在替天上干活。一页烧焦的纸写明了见面地点：男爵的旧残骸，天黑后。",
  "Night falls at 20:00. An ember scratched on the wreck lets you wait for it.": "夜晚从 20:00 开始。残骸上刻的余烬记号可以让你在那里等到天黑。",
  "Halcyon is finished. Nobody is counting Heat any more.": "哈尔西恩完蛋了。再也没人统计警戒值了。",
