  "Ultimate: lightning hammers every enemy on screen. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：闪电轰击屏幕上的所有敌人。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: one cut across the whole screen. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：一刀横贯整个屏幕。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: the pack strikes every enemy on screen. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：狼群扑向屏幕上的所有敌人。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: the whole screen freezes and shatters. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：整个屏幕冻结后碎裂。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: the ground erupts under every enemy on screen. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：地面在屏幕上所有敌人脚下爆裂。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: fire rains on every enemy on screen. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：烈火如雨，落向屏幕上的所有敌人。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: twin giant tornadoes tear across the whole arena. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：两道巨型龙卷风横扫整个场地。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: the whole floor erupts in lava geysers. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：整片地面喷发熔岩泉。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: bombs rain across the whole arena. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：炸弹如雨，落满整个场地。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: appear beside every enemy at once, over and over. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：同时出现在每个敌人身旁，一次又一次。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: a door opens beside every enemy, again and again. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：每个敌人身旁都会打开一扇门，一次又一次。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: the world cracks like a mirror, and every enemy is standing on a crack. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：世界像镜子一样裂开，每个敌人都站在裂缝上。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: one cut, and everything on the screen is on the wrong side of it. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：一刀斩下，屏幕上的一切都落在了错误的一侧。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: fists from every direction at once, then both of them together. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：拳头从四面八方同时袭来，最后双拳齐出。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: a blade of light falls on every enemy, three times. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：光之刃三度落向每个敌人。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: three passes nobody sees, and then every cut arrives at once. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：三次无人看见的掠斩，随后所有刀痕同时迸现。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: every enemy is lifted off the ground. Then gravity remembers them. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：所有敌人离地浮起。然后重力想起了它们。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: time stops for everyone else. You use it. Then it starts again. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：时间为其他人停止。你加以利用。然后时间重新流动。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: every enemy is marked. The bell tolls. Six shots each. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：所有敌人都被标记。钟声响起。每人六发。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: every loose piece of metal on the screen, in one ball, from very high up. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：屏幕上所有零散的金属揉成一团，从极高处砸下。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: every scrap of paper in the room becomes one long dragon, and it goes through everyone. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：屋里每一片纸都化作一条长龙，贯穿所有人。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: everything he has walked, in one punch. It reaches everyone. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：他走过的所有路，凝成一拳。拳及众人。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: the sea comes in, four times, through everyone. What it takes from them, it gives to you. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：海水四度涌入，冲过所有人。它从敌人身上带走的，都归你。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: one arrow, drawn for a long breath, loosed along the whole length of the world. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：一支箭，屏息拉满，沿着整个世界的长度射出。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Ultimate: he brings both fists down on the world three times. Then once more. Costs all three bars, or one while awakened.": "终极技：他双拳砸向世界三次。然后再来一次。消耗全部三格能量，觉醒时只需一格。",
  "Let the drivers go. I will not ask again.": "放了那些司机。我不会再说第二遍。",
  "Let the drivers go, and I will set that arm for you afterwards.": "放了那些司机，之后我帮你把那条胳膊接上。",
  "J: attack - tap for a 4-hit combo. Hold S to guard.\nGuard at the LAST instant for a PERFECT guard: you slip between worlds, and nothing can touch you until you attack.": "J：攻击——连按打出 4 段连击。按住 S 格挡。\n在最后一刻格挡即为完美格挡：你会滑入世界的夹缝，在你出手前任何东西都碰不到你。",
  "Let's go, champ.": "走吧，冠军。",
  "Let's go and ask for it back.": "走，去把它要回来。",
  "Let them go.": "放了他们。",
